<Base
  title="Contact Red River Gorge Hiker"
  description="Contact Ryan D. Lewis about Red River Gorge Hiker photography."
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <h1>Contact Ryan</h1>
    <p class="lede">Questions about a photograph, its story, or possible image use are welcome.</p>
    <p>Red River Gorge Hiker is operated by Red River Gorge Hiker, LLC. Ryan D. Lewis remains the photographer and the contact for photography, image-use, and general Red River Gorge Hiker inquiries.</p>

    <p><a class="button" href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a></p>

    <section>
      <h2>Store orders</h2>
      <p>For questions about a Store purchase, shipment, return, or existing order, Pixels / Fine Art America handles fulfillment and order support for the Red River Gorge Hiker Store.</p>
      <p>
        <a class="button" href="https://store.redrivergorgehiker.com/contactus.html?tab=contactus" data-store-item-type="support">Store Customer Service</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
